<title>USA: Caterpillar engine chosen by Ford.</title>
<headline>Caterpillar engine chosen by Ford.</headline>
<dateline>PEORIA, Ill. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caterpillar Inc said on Thursday its 3126 engine has been chosen by Ford Motor Co for its Louisville commercial truck line.</p>
<p>The 7.2-liter engine will be installed in the 101-inch Louisville trucks beginning in early 1997, the heavy equipment maker said. The engine is already being installed in Louisville 113-inch trucks. Terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
